  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">If you have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.pid3Nv3o23ilx3n6]{Aspect of Tides}, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.iOY6YfGBaOvMNAor]{Underwater Marauder} skill feat. If you have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.8ad23sFdfBpqwklz]{Aspect of Skies}, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.ZBhvJ9O8MvBFAlhq]{Quick Jump} skill feat. In addition, you can channel etheric magic attuned to your aspect, allowing you to enter a fighting style that combines grace and strength with the fury of the storm. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.vNck1Oor9udzoSRj]{Storm Surge Stance} action.</span></p>"
